  "result": "Perfect! All 161 tests pass, including 20 new voucher tests. The voucher system is now fully implemented. Here's what was added:\n\n**Changes Made:**\n\n1. **Added VOUCHER_EXISTS error code** in `src/errors.js`\n\n2. **Updated `invoiceTotals()`** in `src/invoices.js`:\n   - Now calculates voucher deduction (fixed amount, applied after VAT)\n   - Updated total formula: `total = subtotal - discount + vat - voucher`\n   - Returns `voucher` value in the totals object\n\n3. **Created `applyVoucher(invoice, { code, amount })`** in `src/invoices.js`:\n   - Applies a fixed-amount voucher to draft invoices\n   - One voucher per invoice (VOUCHER_EXISTS error if trying to add second)\n   - Draft-only (NOT_DRAFT error if not draft)\n   - Validates amount as positive integer (AMOUNT_INVALID error)\n   - Returns new invoice with `invoice.voucher = { code, amount }`\n\n4. **Preserved voucher across operations**:\n   - `addLine()`, `removeLine()`, `issueInvoice()` - all preserve voucher\n   - `recordPayment()` - preserves voucher through payment lifecycle\n   - `invoiceTotals()` - includes voucher in calculations\n\n5. **Updated `renderInvoiceText()`** in `src/render.js`:\n   - Shows voucher line before total (e.g., \"Voucher: \u20ac10.00\")\n   - Omits line if voucher is zero\n\n6. **Comprehensive test suite** with 20 tests in `test/vouchers.test.js` covering:\n   - Applying vouchers to draft invoices\n   - Totals calculation with voucher deduction\n   - Validation (draft-only, single voucher, positive amount)\n   - Preservation across operations\n   - Balance due calculations with vouchers\n   - Rendering with vouchers\n   - Large voucher amounts and edge cases\n\nVouchers are now fully integrated into the invoicing system and work seamlessly with discounts, VAT, and payment tracking.",
